Suggests: keepassxc | gnome-keyring
Description: Proton VPN-compatible community client for KDE Plasma
 Plasma VPN is an unofficial native Qt 6 and Kirigami frontend compatible
 with Proton VPN. It reuses Proton's official Python VPN Core and daemon.
 VPN protocols, NetworkManager integration, kill-switch behavior, split
 tunneling, and session persistence remain owned by those official components.
 .
 The frontend has no direct GTK or GNOME Keyring dependency and uses the
 Freedesktop Secret Service provider selected by the desktop session. The
 separately packaged API-Core overlay keeps Protun's transient key in its
 unsaved NetworkManager profile. Proton's Core package retains its upstream
 desktop integration dependencies.
